# MeetFlow AI Rules

- Do NOT touch existing `Services/*` files.
- Do NOT touch `Controllers/HomeController.cs` and `Controllers/AudioController.cs`.
- Do NOT touch `Views/Home/Index.cshtml` and `wwwroot/js/site.js`.
- Preserve existing core logic and frontend layout.
- Only make changes to newly assigned modules like Dashboard.
- Make sure to leave `// AI Plan Agent` or `<!-- AI Plan Agent ... -->` comments for AI Traceability.
- Always check `.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE` before adding major features.
